# Local-only scratch space, deliberately not committed: one-off .NET / C++ fixture
# generators (.cache/tools/), clangd index, editor caches, etc. Anything here depends on a machine-local
# checkout and cannot be rebuilt from a clean clone. One ignored cache directory
# keeps clangd, editors and throwaway scripts in the same place instead of one
# ignore rule per helper.
# Tracked outputs (e.g. csharp.tsv, cxx.tsv) live in crates/; recipes are in DESIGN
# §12.5 and §19.1.
/.cache/
